Stream analyzer input after child startup.

Pinned upstream: rhysd/actionlint v1.7.10, process.go.
The original writes the whole input into a pipe before starting its reader;
small pipe buffers can block workflow lint indefinitely. os/exec copies a
Reader concurrently with the running child. Remove this patch when the pinned
upstream implements the same behavior.

